  "title": "Dutch central bank moves gold reserves to London amid geopolitical unrest",
  "summary": "The Dutch central bank removed billions of gold reserves from the US and Canada to London, citing increased geopolitical unrest and the need to respond more effectively in a crisis. This move aims to enhance the tradability and resilience of its gold holdings.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "The Dutch central bank announced that it removed 86 metric tons of gold reserves from the US and Canada to London.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The move was described as a 'crisis preparedness' move in response to global political unrest.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The gold reserves now hold 18.5% of the Dutch central bank's total holdings.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
